&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://discourse.gohugo.io/t/filenames-for-code-blocks/32466"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;Filenames for code blocks&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a
class="link"
